<Callout type="info">

Import releases searches from an item in your Radarr or Sonarr library, so add the movie or series there first. The search goes out to your indexers and can take a while. Each imported release keeps the size, indexers, languages, and flags its indexers reported, and near-identical releases are merged into one.

</Callout>

<ThemeImage
	dark="/images/docs_qp_testing_release[style=dark].png"
